{title: Lantern Hymn}
{key: F}
{time: 3/4}

{start_of_verse: label="Verse"}
[C]The [F]lamp is [Bb]lit [F]a[C]gain
[F]and we [Bb]sing to [C7]keep it [F]warm
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: label="Verse"}
[C]The [F]night is [Bb]long [F]and [C]still
[F]and the [Bb]stars are [C7]on the [F]hill
{end_of_verse}
